s are thoroughly assessed to inform subsequent service planning.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Service Plan' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Assess Client Needs' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Service Plan' activity involves creating a tailored service plan based on the assessed client needs, outlining the duration and specific interventions required.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Assess Client Needs\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Client Needs' activity represents the initial evaluation phase where the client's requirements and risk factors are thoroughly assessed to inform subsequent service planning.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Obtain Funding Approval' activity occurs, then a 'Provide Counseling Services' activity must eventually occur after the 'Obtain Funding Approval' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Obtain Funding Approval' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Provide Counseling Services' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Obtain Funding Approval'. If 'Obtain Funding Approval' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Provide Counseling Services'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Obtain Funding Approval\",\"description\":\"The 'Obtain Funding Approval' activity includes requesting and securing approval for the necessary funding amount to support the client's service plan.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Counseling Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Counseling Services' activity entails delivering counseling sessions of a specified type to address the client's emotional and psychological needs.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Provide Counseling Services' activity must be followed by a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Monitor Client Progress' event can occur only if a 'Provide Counseling Services' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Provide Counseling Services' impose obligations for future 'Monitor Client Progress', and 'Monitor Client Progress' cannot occur without prior 'Provide Counseling Services'. Multiple 'Provide Counseling Services' and 'Monitor Client Progress' are allowed, with each 'Provide Counseling Services' eventually leading to a 'Monitor Client Progress' and each 'Monitor Client Progress' being justified by a preceding 'Provide Counseling Services'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Provide Counseling Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Counseling Services' activity entails delivering counseling sessions of a specified type to address the client's emotional and psychological needs.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Client Progress\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Client Progress' activity involves regularly tracking and evaluating the client's advancement using a progress score to ensure the service plan remains effective.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Adjust Service Plan' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, a 'Monitor Client Progress' event cannot be immediately preceded by an 'Ad