ectly.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Client Risk Level is High\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Client Progress' activity occurs with the condition that 'Progress Score < 50', then an 'Adjust Service Plan' activity must eventually occur after the 'Monitor Client Progress' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Monitor Client Progress' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Adjust Service Plan' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Monitor Client Progress'. If 'Monitor Client Progress' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Adjust Service Plan'. The time condition must be triggered in at most 7 days.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Client Progress\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Client Progress' activity involves regularly tracking and evaluating the client's advancement using a progress score to ensure the service plan remains effective.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Adjust Service Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Adjust Service Plan' activity requires modifying the existing service plan in response to factors like progress, setbacks, or new needs identified during monitoring.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Progress Score < 50\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,7,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Develop Service Plan' activity occurs with the condition that 'Service Plan Duration > 6', then a 'Refer to Specialist' activity must eventually occur after the 'Develop Service Plan' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Develop Service Plan' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Refer to Specialist' can fulfill the obligation for all prece